# The measured-ISS handoff files are verified byte-for-byte against the SHA256s in
# real_spacecraft_measurements/CORE_TRANSFER_MANIFEST.json before use. Never convert their
# line endings (core.autocrlf would otherwise check them out as CRLF on Windows and the
# measured models would correctly report "unavailable" due to hash mismatch).
real_spacecraft_measurements/** -text
outputs/measured_iss/** -text
